{"flaviocopes":{"plays":[{"id":"flaviocopes-1","emoji":"📝","title":"Daily Tutorial Drop","description":"Publish one short, problem-first tutorial tied to a tool developers are actively adopting (Cloudflare Workers, AI agent frameworks, React patterns).","action":"Write a 600-900 word post with a working code snippet, publish on flaviocopes.com/blog, and share the headline plus one takeaway on X with a link.","frequency":"Daily"},{"id":"flaviocopes-2","emoji":"📚","title":"Handbook Edition Launch","description":"Refresh a flagship handbook (JavaScript, TypeScript, CSS, Node.js) with a dated edition to signal authority and evergreen utility.","action":"Ship a '2026 edition' update, announce the changelog in 3 bullets on X, and pin the handbook landing page for 7 days.","frequency":"Monthly"},{"id":"flaviocopes-3","emoji":"🎓","title":"Cohort Workshop Promo","description":"Run time-bound cohorts (AI Workshop, Bootcamp, masterclasses) that convert tutorial readers into paid learners.","action":"Post enrollment window dates, 2 student outcomes, and a single CTA link 3x during the signup period across X and email.","frequency":"Monthly"},{"id":"flaviocopes-4","emoji":"🛠️","title":"Hands-On Tool Review","description":"Test emerging dev/AI tools in public and document setup steps, limits, and when to use them.","action":"Ship a 'hands-on guide' post (e.g., Executor, Val Town, agent frameworks), include screenshots or CLI output, and thread 5 numbered steps on X.","frequency":"Weekly"},{"id":"flaviocopes-5","emoji":"🧱","title":"AHA Stack Evangelism","description":"Promote the AHA Stack (Astro, HTMX, Alpine) as a pragmatic alternative to heavy SPA stacks for indie builders.","action":"Publish one comparison or starter template, tag relevant communities, and link to ahastack.dev from every related tutorial for 30 days.","frequency":"Weekly"}],"hooks":["How to [do specific task] with [tool] — a quick guide","The [Language] Handbook (2026 edition) is out","I tested [new AI/dev tool] so you don't have to — here's what works","[N] tutorials later, here's the one pattern every [framework] dev should know","Join the [AI Workshop/Bootcamp] — cohort starts [date]","Stop overcomplicating [problem]: do this instead"],"angles":["Beginner-friendly how-to tutorials with copy-paste code","Annual handbook releases as authority anchors","Live cohort education for AI-era software development","Tool discovery posts on fast-moving dev/AI stacks","Practical web development best practices without hype","Solopreneur and indie-builder skill bridges"]},"thepatwalls":{"plays":[{"id":"thepatwalls-1","emoji":"🎬","title":"Revenue-Headline Episode Clip","description":"Turn founder interviews into X-native clips led by concrete revenue numbers and time-to-profit milestones.","action":"Cut a 30-60s clip from a Starter Story interview, open with '$XXK/mo in YY days', and link the full breakdown on starterstory.com.","frequency":"Weekly"},{"id":"thepatwalls-2","emoji":"📊","title":"Live Data Table Drop","description":"Share searchable founder data (revenue, cost to start, tools used, growth channel) from the Starter Story database.","action":"Screenshot or embed one row from starterstory.com/data with 3 filters (e.g., Micro-SaaS, solopreneur), add one insight, and invite replies with niche requests.","frequency":"Weekly"},{"id":"thepatwalls-3","emoji":"💡","title":"Curated Idea Database Promo","description":"Promote one of 36+ curated databases (weekend projects, GPT wrappers, boring niches) as a build menu for aspiring founders.","action":"Post the database name, median revenue stat, and 2 example ideas with links; end with 'pick one and ship this weekend'.","frequency":"Weekly"},{"id":"thepatwalls-4","emoji":"📬","title":"Weekly Build Newsletter","description":"Deliver one founder-tested business idea plus supporting case studies to grow the email list and repeat visits.","action":"Send the weekly newsletter, repost the top idea on X with revenue proof, and A/B test hooks 